    "body": "Also note https://github.com/PowerShell/PSReadLine/pull/1180, if needed.\r\n\r\nNote that by default starship colors the prompt character depending on whether the previous command succeeded or not. So will need a different color to be distinguishable. But also, I'm not sure if it will correctly support restoring the previous color of the prompt character once it gets replaced by this.",
